WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.808
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:05.870 --> 00:00:07.620
SPEAKER 1: In this
video, we will show you

00:00:07.620 --> 00:00:10.530
how to predict prices using
a machine learning model

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:13.980
from Google Sheets, find
NASDAQ composite index

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:17.430
price historical data and
download it, open the sheet,

00:00:17.430 --> 00:00:19.590
import the data,
and create a chart.

00:00:23.170 --> 00:00:26.020
Open Script Editor.

00:00:26.020 --> 00:00:30.760
Go to ml-integration-samples
at GitHub and copy the code.

00:00:30.760 --> 00:00:32.500
Go back to Script Editor.

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:34.120
Paste the code.

00:00:34.120 --> 00:00:38.440
Add BigQuery API service.

00:00:38.440 --> 00:00:41.490
Deploy the code.

00:00:41.490 --> 00:00:45.660
In the sheet, specify
GCP project ID.

00:00:45.660 --> 00:00:48.120
Select Date and Open columns.

00:00:48.120 --> 00:00:49.680
Train the model.

00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:54.150
Add 900 rows and select them
to forecast the price movement

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:56.280
for the next 900 days.

00:00:56.280 --> 00:00:59.640
Select Forecast to render
the price prediction.

00:00:59.640 --> 00:01:00.390
That's it.

00:01:00.390 --> 00:01:03.690
To learn more about the ML
integration sample code,

00:01:03.690 --> 00:01:07.370
look at the links in
the video description.

